Z||000000||kslish||02-09-2001||01:18 PM||||Due to the 70 degree day we are having here in Pittsburgh, I'm starting to think about what I want to do on my Fiero's this year. <P>The GT just got new AC Rapidfire plugs last fall and a set of Magnecor plug wires are on order....the distributor cap and rotor are the next on the "tune-up" list.<P>Is there a "preferred" brand of distributor cap and rotor set, or are all of them pretty much the same?  I know to look for brass terminal fittings but that's about it.  I've been buying Wells Professional brand in the past (since they are red colored) but I can't find them locally anymore.  The only premium set I can find is made by Accel.  Any pros and cons between brands?<P>Ken S.<BR>'87 GT and '86 SC<BR> <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A> ||||reg||5
